  "and": " and ",
  "prompt": "Tick your pollens to see only yours. Meanwhile, all eight are below.",
  "strong": "With {pollens} allergy, the best documented foods are: {foods}.",
  "other": "Also reported: {foods}.",
  "onlyReported": "With {pollens} allergy, reactions have been reported to: {foods}.",
  "stableWarning": "Careful: for at least one of your pollens the protein involved survives cooking. Cooking or peeling does not make the food safe, and reactions can be severe. See its section."
